  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The architect is proficient with all simple weapons, crossbows (any weapon from the fighter’s crossbow weapon group), siege weapons, and with light and medium armor as well as shields other than tower shields. An architect can cast architect spells in light or medium armor without incurring the normal arcane spell failure chance.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/architect#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
